    id: 'q8-13', bloom: 'Apply', objective: 'B8.5',
    prompt: 'In the same listing a student argues that noise is measured at the pad edge, so the vertiports should satisfy the noise requirement, and writes satisfy \'REQ-SYS-002\' by aeroLink.\'PHY-002\'; where PHY-002 is typed VertiportNetwork, which also declares padEdgeNoise. The subject of REQ-SYS-002 is still aircraft : EVTOLAircraft. The course checker reports PASS with one warning, “Bound features should have conforming types”. Which statement is correct?',
