      'The tools apply the course coverage rule (information needs an information interface; energy and material a physical one; an organisational interface carries no flow). Students who retype an agreement as “information” to clear an advisory have hidden the gap, not closed it (q8-11).',
      'Micro-lab 3 is read-only. Students must not install a modelling tool this week; L9 onboarding does that.',
      'Accessibility: every matrix has row and column headers; types are written as letters (P, I, O) and checks as ✓ / ✗ / ! with words, never by colour alone; all controls are labelled and keyboard-operable.',
